@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = REEMPLAZA_CON_TOKEN_ADMIN
@studentToken = REEMPLAZA_CON_TOKEN_STUDENT1
@auditorToken = REEMPLAZA_CON_TOKEN_AUDITOR

### Health fixed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/health

### Escenarios corregidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/scenarios

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Login auditor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "auditor@demo.local",
  "password": "Auditor123!"
}

### Login student1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student1@demo.local",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

### Repetir 5 veces para generar MultipleFailedLogins
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "PasswordIncorrecto123!"
}

### Alumno intenta endpoint admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Alumno intenta expediente ajeno. Repetir 2 veces para alerta StudentRecordProbing.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/student-records/by-user/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Crear ticket de seguridad
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/support-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Actividad sospechosa en mi cuenta",
  "description": "Vi intentos de acceso que no reconozco y quiero que seguridad revise la actividad.",
  "isSecurityRelevant": true
}

### Ver eventos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/security/events?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ver alertas abiertas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/security/alerts?onlyUnacknowledged=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Dashboard defensivo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/security/dashboard-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{auditorToken}}
